  "notes": [
    "**Pensar** is a stem-changing verb: e→ie",
    "Present: stem change e→ie (except nosotros)",
    "Preterite: regular -AR endings, NO stem change",
    "Imperfect: regular -AR pattern, NO stem change",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: regular past participle **pensado**",
    "Future: regular future endings attached to infinitive",
    "Condicional: regular conditional endings attached to infinitive",
    "Often used with \"en\": *pensar en algo/alguien* (to think about something/someone)",
    "Can also mean \"to plan/intend\" when followed by infinitive: *Pienso ir* (I plan to go)",
    "Common usage: *¿Qué piensas?* (What do you think?),"
  ],
